// matters on the desk, and name where it shows in the app. `related` are
// glossary ids; `links` are docsCatalog ids and help: deep links. Source of
// the definitions: Docs/handoff/notes/00_system_overview.md (the vocabulary
// paragraph and the invariants) and the notes each entry links.
